@startuml architecture-before
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title OmniFlow and QuickFaaS as disjoint tools

actor Developer as D1
component "OmniFlow DSL" as DSL1
component "GoogleCloudDeployer" as GCD1
component "AmazonCloudDeployer" as ACD1
component "QuickFaaS\n(GCP / Azure only)" as QF1
cloud "Google Cloud Workflows" as GCW1
cloud "AWS Step Functions" as SF1
cloud "Cloud Functions" as FN1

D1 --> DSL1
D1 --> QF1 : separate manual step
D1 ..> DSL1 : manual endpoint copy
DSL1 --> GCD1
DSL1 --> ACD1
GCD1 --> GCW1 : YAML
ACD1 --> SF1 : ASL JSON
QF1 --> FN1

note bottom of ACD1
  No function-deployment capability on AWS
  (NoopInternalFunctionDeployer)
end note
@enduml
